      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1790
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "四个选项多为名词。",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1791
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1792
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "名词题常通过上下文语义场和搭配锁定。",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1793
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先判类别：人、物、事件、结果、感受、品质，再比具体词",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1794
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义。”",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1795
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 先确定空位“功能类别”能大幅减少选项。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1796
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1797
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看冠词/形容词/介词判断空位确实要名词。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1798
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 问这个名词在句中表示什么类别。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1799
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 找上下文重复/同义词。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1800
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 检查固定搭配和单复数语义。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1801
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1802
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1803
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1804
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· make a decision / take action / give advice 等搭配可直接锁定",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1805
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 前文出现“fear”后文可能用“anxiety”同义复现",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1806
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 词义、类别、搭配同时成立。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1807
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个名词都合理时，查前后是否有同义复现或更具体的情节指向。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1808
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1809
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Her kind words gave me the ___ to try again. 语义需要“勇气/信心”类抽象名词，不是具体物品。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1810
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1811
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只因为一个词“高级”就选。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1812
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略冠词与单复数。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1813
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1814
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 类别对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1815
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 搭配对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1816
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 上下文有复现吗？",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1817
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1818
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1819
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1820
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 名词先判“它是什么类别”。",
      "sourcePage": 65,
      "sourceIndex": 1821
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1823
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 名词题先判断？",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1824
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. “a sense of ___”通常需要？",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1825
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 前文反复提problem，后文solution可能构成？",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1826
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 两个名词都认识但一具体一抽象，怎么选？",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1827
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 名词单复数是否也可能影响选择？",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1828
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 缺人/物/事件/结果/感受/概念哪一类。；2. 名词；3. 语义呼应。；4. 看句子需要的语义类别。；5.",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1829
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "会。",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1830
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— C2 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“C2”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 66,
      "sourceIndex": 1831
    }
